@startuml

title Password Generator - Class Diagram

class PasswordGenerator {
    - length: int
    - characters: str

    + generate_password(length: int): str
}

class PasswordValidator {
    + validate_password(password: str): bool
    - has_digit(password: str): bool
    - has_uppercase(password: str): bool
    - has_lowercase(password: str): bool
}

class CLI {
    + main(): None
    - parse_arguments(): int
    - display_password(password: str): None
}

CLI --> PasswordGenerator : uses
CLI --> PasswordValidator : uses

@enduml